  "summary": "C21 saves C17's cached mask, produced by threshold comparisons followed by per-cell run detection and gap joining. Directly using the 1-based doy_t as an array index shifts threshold lookup forward one day; smoothing and pooling therefore bring May 13–September 21 SST from each baseline year into the mask, together with every target day's SST at every sea cell."
